{# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   THE MISSION - Built by Healers
   ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ #}
<section style="padding: 96px 24px; background: var(--color-paper);">
  <div style="max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <div class="mission-grid">
      <div>
        <p style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-ferni); margin-bottom: 16px;">Our Mission</p>
        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 42px); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 24px;">Built by a family of healers.<br>For everyone.</h2>
        <div class="mission-text">
          <p>
            Doug and Betty Ford spent decades as therapists—sitting with people in their hardest moments. Our sister Mindy became a recreational therapist. We grew up surrounded by conversations about what it really means to help someone.
          </p>
          <p>
            We noticed something: <strong>the most important conversations happen at inconvenient times.</strong>
          </p>
